  "description": "Reptilian Rising is a retro-style, turn-based strategy RPG where history’s greatest heroes take on the most ridiculous crisis time has ever seen. Assemble a squad of legends – from Cleopatra and Robin Hood to Einstein – and fight across randomly generated battlefields, from prehistoric jungles to dystopian futures.\n\nHarness time-based powers to clone your troops, summon reinforcements, or open time gates for rapid deployment. Face bizarre Reptilian foes including dino-cyborgs, Manborgs, and the ultimate villain: the Dictatorsaur.\n\nWith reactive combat, over 20 playable heroes, and branching missions, no two runs are ever the same. Save humanity in style. Open the door, get on the floor… and shoot the dinosaur!\n\nKey Features\n- Turn-based squad tactics with reactive combat twists\n- 20+ iconic heroes to recruit from history, myth, and beyond\n- Dozens of outrageous reptilian enemies and 9 unique boss fights\n- Strategic upgrade system including artefacts, cloning, time gates and more\n- High replayability through mission branching and bonus objectives\n- Digitally realised ‘80s tabletop-inspired aesthetic",
